  "task": "Task: Generate NDVI time series composite\nGenerate a multi-temporal NDVI composite stack from Sentinel-2 surface reflectance data over the Bijapur district for agricultural monitoring. It processes 12 bi-monthly image collections from October 2022 to March 2023, computes NDVI for each period, applies greenest-pixel compositing using qualityMosaic, masks clouds and non-agricultural areas, and exports a scaled 12-band NDVI composite raster clipped to the study area. Additionally, it creates and exports a true-color mosaic from a specific date for reference.",
