  "task": "Task: Monitor cotton vegetation health\nMonitor cotton crop health in Kalaburgi district using time-series NDVI derived from Sentinel-2 imagery between August and December 2022. It computes NDVI for nine bi-monthly periods, applies cloud masking using B2 threshold, masks non-agricultural areas using an agricultural mask, scales the NDVI values to uint8, and generates a stacked composite of scaled NDVI layers. The output includes individual NDVI maps visualized with SLD styling, a composite image for export, and a true-color mosaic from November 2022 for reference. Final outputs are exported to Google Drive as a layer stack and a sentinel reference image.",
