 {
  "row_idx": 1234,
  "task": "Task: Map land surface changes over time\nGenerate median composite images from multiple Landsat and Sentinel-2 surface reflectance datasets across five time periods (2000, 2005, 2010, 2015, 2020) to visualize and export land surface changes. It applies sensor-specific cloud masking functions (for Landsat 4–8 and Sentinel-2) to improve data quality, computes median pixel values within each period, clips to a region of interest (roi), and visualizes the results using a near-infrared false-color composite (B4, B5, B3). Outputs include layered maps for visualization and five separate GeoTIFF exports of the median composites at 30m resolution for change analysis.",
