  "task": "Task: Monitor cotton vegetation health\nMonitor cotton crop health in Belgaum district using NDVI derived from Sentinel-2 imagery between October and December 2022. It processes five temporal image composites, computes NDVI for each period, applies cloud masking and agricultural land masking, then generates a stacked NDVI composite. The output includes a multi-temporal NDVI raster map visualized with a custom SLD color scheme and exported as a clipped uint8 image for further analysis, along with a true-color Sentinel-2 mosaic for reference.",
